.L19098:
    .string "(use core/core)\n(defn main () (let t (tuple 1 2) (begin (print (tuple-get t 1)) 0)))"
.L19099:
    .string "E_CAPABILITY_LEAK"
.L19100:
    .string "Mutable state crosses to another actor: a captured let-mut, ByteBuf, Ref or other mutable handle, one sent over a channel, or a top-level def of one an actor reaches. Share numbers through an AtomicBuf instead."
.L19101:
    .string "(capabilities actor)\n(use actor/actor)\n(defn main () (let b (bytebuf Heap 8) (let a (spawn (fn () (store-u8! :le b 0 1))) (begin (actor-wait a) 0))))"
