.L19119:
    .string "E_CONTRACT_EFFECT"
.L19120:
    .string "A `requires`, `ensures` or `invariant` condition does I/O, calls foreign code, uses an actor or channel, changes shared state or exits, itself or through a function it calls; the profile decides whether a condition runs, so it may only compute."
