.L19811:
    .string "Start an actor running a zero-argument function or closure; an Actor. Endpoints it captures move to it. Join it with `actor-wait` (actor/actor), which re-raises its panic. Rejected (E_CAPABILITY_LEAK) on a captured let-mut, a `Secret`, or anything that reaches mutable state another actor could see: a ByteBuf, a Ref or another mutable handle, captured or held in captured data, or a top-level def of one reached from the actor. The one shared buffer is an AtomicBuf (atomic/atomic), captured directly. At most 1024 actors per program (E_ACTOR_LIMIT)."
